A dam of sandstone holds back a lake of fire. Below it waits a pan of oil, and beyond the rim lies the open sea. Dig the keystone - or blast it - and watch the cascade: burning oil, stone born where fire meets water, steam flashing to rain over the burnt terrace, and a dune on the move.\par
